title: A session's transcript is silent while the session waits on a subagent.
pid: 2b15ec83-3032-4655-8455-c6943466703c
body: |2-
  So its last record can come long before the session ends: session
  6a206de9 wrote nothing after 09:03, and its background subagent ran
  until the pacer stopped it at 09:13. The account therefore ends a
  session at its last subagent's end, and then agrees with the pacer's
  log to the second for every pacer session.
